// PromptSegmentProvider — async prompt segments (git status, k8s context,
// cloud account, …) from a resident plugin.
//
// The gitstatusd lesson, made a contract: prompt data is computed out of
// process and the prompt never blocks on it. The host calls Render with a
// deadline derived from the segment's declared budget; on a miss it
